    89	# PLAN-156 Wave 2 (SENT-GK-A) — grok adapter AUTO-DETECT (pair-rail S269 P1 #1).
    90	#
    91	# THE CRITICAL single-surface fix. The grok harness arms the legacy-compat
    92	# `.claude/settings.json`, whose hook commands do NOT carry
