   103	# var is present and the adapter is unset, we ARE under grok — select it. This
   104	# is what makes the single-surface (`.claude/settings.json`) armed rail
   105	# actually enforce under grok. An explicit CEO_HOOK_ADAPTER always wins (tests,
   106	# codex, a deliberate override).
